      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greensboro%2C_Georgia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Greensboro’s downtown features the historic Airdome Theater, once a community gathering spot, now a reminder of early 20th‑century entertainment.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
